# Pinned gitleaks release. Sourced by install.sh.
#
# The hashes are the SHA-256 values of gitleaks_${VERSION}_<platform>.tar.gz from the release's
# official checksums file. They are pinned here so that a download is checked against a value
# reviewed in this repository, not against a file fetched from the same place as the binary.
# To update: change VERSION, replace the four hashes, run `./tests/run.sh`.

